      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**1. 向量是位移.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**2. 向量将射线映射成和它同向的射线，将直线映射成和**",
        "**它平行的直线.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
